{"id":64,"date":"2024-12-29T20:55:59","date_gmt":"2024-12-29T20:55:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ascendbuildingrenovations.co.uk\/about\/"},"modified":"2026-01-12T17:29:55","modified_gmt":"2026-01-12T17:29:55","slug":"about","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/ascendbuildingrenovations.co.uk\/about\/","title":{"rendered":"About"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"64\" class=\"elementor elementor-64\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9476fc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f9476fc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f0f288 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2f0f288\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-046c31a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"046c31a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Story<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f056b4 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8f056b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"462\">Most people looking for a decorator or plasterer want the same things: work done properly, clear communication and no unnecessary stress.<\/p><p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"770\">Ascend Building Renovations was founded by Matthew Anderson, who began his career through a traditional painting and decorating apprenticeship straight after leaving school. During his training, Matthew went on to win a CITB SkillBuild competition, recognising both technical skill and attention to detail.<\/p><p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"1088\">After qualifying, he worked for a housing association and later for a property developer and landlord, where he expanded his skill set to include plastering, damp-related repairs and broader renovation work. Alongside this, he achieved an NVQ Level 3 in Painting &amp; Decorating and a Foundation Degree in Construction.<\/p><p data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1334\">Today, Ascend Building Renovations brings together that hands-on trade background with a practical, organised way of working. From first contact to completion, the focus is on clear advice, tidy workmanship and finishes that stand up over time.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54a4e10 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"54a4e10\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7361cd5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7361cd5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6cb024e e-con-full elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6cb024e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afa9278 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"afa9278\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4eb6e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f4eb6e5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What We Do<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e8b8196 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e8b8196\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1505\">We help homeowners, landlords and businesses improve and maintain their properties through professional painting, decorating and plastering services.<\/p><p data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1702\">Our work covers interior and exterior decorating, plastering and wall repairs, plasterboard and ceiling work, damp and mould repairs, and full property refreshes for rental and commercial spaces.<\/p><p data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1981\">Every job is approached with care and attention to preparation, because that\u2019s what makes the difference to the final result. Whether it\u2019s a single room or a larger project, we aim to deliver a clean, well-finished outcome and a straightforward experience from start to finish.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab0ec1e elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"ab0ec1e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-grow\" href=\"https:\/\/ascendbuildingrenovations.co.uk\/services\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Learn more about our services<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79653d3f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"79653d3f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-605fa48 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"605fa48\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Choose Us<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e38d1a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5e38d1a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2130\">Choosing the right decorator or plasterer is about trust and peace of mind.<\/p><p data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2338\">We take a practical, organised approach to every job, focusing on preparation, clear communication and steady progress. You\u2019ll know what\u2019s being done, how long it will take and what to expect at each stage.<\/p><p data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2540\">Whether it\u2019s a small repair or a larger renovation, the same standards apply. Work is planned properly, carried out with respect for your space, and finished to a level we\u2019re happy to put our name to.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-629fedc2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"629fedc2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-521e1b90 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"521e1b90\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ready to talk?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e850b30 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e850b30\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you\u2019re planning a decorating or plastering project and want clear advice and reliable workmanship, we\u2019re happy to help. Get in touch to discuss your job, ask a question or arrange a visit.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a034785 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"a034785\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-grow\" href=\"https:\/\/ascendbuildingrenovations.co.uk\/contact\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Request Your Free Quote<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e30a2f0 e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e30a2f0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;shape_divider_top&quot;:&quot;tilt&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shape elementor-shape-top\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-negative=\"false\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n\t<path class=\"elementor-shape-fill\" d=\"M0,6V0h1000v100L0,6z\"\/>\n<\/svg>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0465896 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0465896\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Hear From Our Happy Customers<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-025e1fc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"025e1fc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60e42ec elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget-tablet_extra__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial\" data-id=\"60e42ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"testimonial.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-content\">\u201cWe had mould issues in a bedroom and were really impressed with how thoroughly it was dealt with. The room now looks brand new and we were given clear advice on prevention going forward.\u201d<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial-meta-inn